# Claw Bakery local-driver state · NEVER committed.
#
# In dev: this directory is the LocalDriver storage root (filesystem
# bakery vault · mutable state · regenerated by every benchmark run +
# every ClawCheck intake). In production, the bakery uses the S3
# driver pointed at the existing s3_private_evidence_bucket · this
# directory does not exist at all.
#
# To inspect the bakery contents locally: just ls into it. To reset
# the local bakery: `rm -rf data/claw-bakery && mkdir -p data/claw-bakery`.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
